  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Deep Ellum Blues**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **Beat It on Down the Line**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **A Hard Rain's Gonna Fall**: back after 34 archived shows (485 days); rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **NFA Chant**: back after 65 archived shows (697 days); rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **DeadCo2017-11-24** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 154 min; rated 2.5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Not the best recording, but it captures more audience noise than the version sold on the band's official website [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer compares this taper recording with the officially sold version, keeping both on their phone; the crowd noise is the difference [2]\n- Reviewer ranks this among the better shows they'd seen since the band members reunited [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **DeadCo2017-11-24**: taped by JB-Broz; transferred by ImMaxPowers; source: Knowles MEMS > iphone [1]",
